# NOTE: the release keystore (android/app/kartoonia-release.jks) and
# android/key.properties are intentionally COMMITTED. This app is sideloaded
# (not on Play Store), and the in-app updater installs release APKs OVER the
# running app — Android only allows that when every build is signed with the
# SAME key. A committed key guarantees that across local builds and CI. The
# trade-off (the signing key is public) is acceptable for a non-Play-Store app.
